  "slides": [
    {
      "type": "cover",
      "main": ["HOSPITAL RECORDS"],
      "sub": "when everyone ran dark, two men stayed light"
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "1996. Forest Hill, South London.",
        "",
        "Tony Colman and Chris Goss",
        "built a label from a small studio.",
        "",
        "They called it Hospital Records."
      ],
      "sub": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "The catalog numbers start with NHS.",
        "",
        "NHS — the National Health Service.",
        "Britain's system for free public healthcare.",
        "",
        "They weren't making music.",
        "They were writing prescriptions."
      ],
      "sub": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "Metalheadz went dark.",
        "Virus built machines.",
        "Ram went harder.",
        "",
        "Hospital chose melody."
      ],
      "sub": "\"Song in the Key of Knife\" — 1998. The first cut that put them on the map."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "2002. High Contrast. Wales.",
        "Lincoln Barrett was 22.",
        "",
        "Fabio played it.",
        "Andy C played it.",
        "Hype played it.",
        "",
        "That never happens.",
        "One record cannot belong to everyone.",
        "This one did."
      ],
      "sub": "\"Return of Forever\" — True Colours (2002)"
    },
    {
      "type": "quote",
      "quote": [
        "The music should reach people",
        "who don't know",
        "they need it yet."
      ],
      "note": "Liquid DnB. Not a softer version. A different philosophy."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "The podcast launched in 2004.",
        "One of the first music podcasts in the world.",
        "",
        "Then Hospitality in the Park.",
        "Then Hospitality on the Beach, Croatia.",
        "",
        "A label became a community.",
        "A community became a movement."
      ],
      "sub": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "cta",
      "text": [
        "The light stayed on.",
        "",
        "Every NHS release.",
        "Every Outpatients compilation.",
        "Every Hospitality night.",
        "",
        "A reminder that melody",
        "is not weakness."
      ],
      "strobe": "PLUR SYSTEM DIARY",
      "cta": "Save this."
    }
  ]
}
